From dc18b2e96e238e41c277b75123c2f4d025dd93ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 06:06:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Wire due dates, reminders, AI generation and PDF receipts
 into the UI

- Add payment terms picker (Due Today/7/14/30 days/Custom) to the
  credit sale form; sale transactions now store a due date + issued
  receipt reference.
- Add a Reminder Preview screen: template picker (with Pro badges +
  gating), tone selector, working AI generation via the existing
  server function, editable message, and Send via WhatsApp - which
  now logs to reminder history instead of just opening a link.
- Wire PDF receipt/statement downloads and a copy-summary action
  using the existing receipts.ts, alongside the existing WhatsApp
  text share.
- Add color-coded due-date badges to the customer list, detail
  screen and per-transaction rows, plus Due Today/Due This Week
  dashboard stats and filter chips.
- Replace ad-hoc local Stat/Chip/Field/Header components with the
  shared ui-kit (also gains the offline indicator for free).
- Mount Toaster in the root route so toast feedback renders.
- Fix pre-existing Prettier violations in touched lib files.
